{
  "title": "A Cooperative Built on Craft and Trust",
  "description": "For decades, TGSCO has stood as the official custodian of Telangana's handloom tradition, connecting thousands of weavers directly to the people who value their work. Formed to protect the livelihoods of weaving communities and preserve dying art forms, TGSCO exists so that no thread of this heritage is lost to time. We work hand-in-hand with cooperative societies across the state, ensuring fair wages, authentic craftsmanship, and a future for the next generation of weavers.",
  "button": {
    "label": "Learn More About TGSCO",
    "url": "/about"
  },
